            <description>&lt;h2&gt;More reliable document menus&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixes a crash when opening a document's context menu on macOS versions before 27, including macOS 26.6.2.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The menu retains its native icons and actions. This update also strengthens build checks for compatibility with supported macOS versions.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
