            <description>&lt;h2&gt;Updates, built into Papers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Check for new versions from the Papers menu or General Settings using native macOS update dialogs.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Choose daily automatic checks and optionally download updates to install when Papers quits.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Requested update restarts wait for active imports, document changes, and transfers to finish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your connection settings and local document cache remain in place when Papers updates.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
